      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Coriolis force is zero at the equator and reaches its maximum strength at the geographic poles.",
        "Land breeze blows from land to sea during the night, whereas sea breeze blows from sea to land during the day.",
        "Chinook is known as the 'Snow Eater' due to its snow-melting effect on the eastern slopes of the Rocky Mountains.",
        "Tropical jet streams (e.g., Tropical Easterly Jet) play a vital role in the onset and intensity of the Indian Summer Monsoon."
